<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your journey to {!Case.Arrival_City__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Arrival_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" style="">I assure you we understand how inconvenient schedule changes are, and try hard to avoid them where ever possible. Occasional flight changes are a normal part of all airlines operations. <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">I am sorry to hear about the impact this had on your planned itinerary.</span></font></p><font size="2" style=""><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" style="">When changes occur, we know how important it is to let you know straight away so you can adjust your plans accordingly. I can see that an email was sent to you on <b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><i>-DATE</i>-</b> advising you of the change.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If requesting compensation add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">We are unable to meet your request for <b><i>-a refund of your missed accommodation/compensation etc-. </i></b> What I can do, is send you a letter confirming the schedule change, if this will help you make a claim through any travel insurance policy you hold. Please let me know if you would like me to arrange this for you.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If wants to know why add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Scheduling is affected by a huge variety of operational factors, such as planned and unplanned aircraft maintenance, commercial viability of routes, seasonal adjustments, special events and changes to codeshare arrangements with our partner airlines. Each aircraft in our fleet operates across multiple routes, and any change, can have a knock-on effect across our entire network. It is not always possible to identify a specific reason for each schedule change.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">We are grateful you let us know about your experience and hope we can welcome you on board again in the future.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>